1. "I earn this much money. How should I divide it?"
2. "I am thinking of making this financial decision. Is it actually a good idea for me?"

The first is solved by the Smart Allocation Engine.

The second is solved by the AI Financial Decision Agent.

The second capability is the heart of the product and must receive the most attention in the design and implementation.